{"source_term":"取","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"保存本卷明示親屬主張；不據此排除其他來源異說，不補生母姓名。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"a-shiji006-003","subject_person_id":"cbr-p000533","predicate":"mother","object_person_id":"cbr-p000542","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p001","quote":"見呂不韋姬，悅而取之，生始皇","chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"生","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"保存本卷明示親屬主張；不據此排除其他來源異說，不補生母姓名。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p001","text":"秦始皇帝者，秦莊襄王子也。莊襄王為秦質子於趙，見呂不韋姬，悅而取之，生始皇。以秦昭王四十八年正月生於邯鄲。及生，名為政，姓趙氏。年十三歲，莊襄王死，政代立為秦王。當是之時，秦地已并巴、蜀、漢中，越宛有郢，置南郡矣；北收上郡以東，有河東、太原、上黨郡；東至滎陽，滅二周，置三川郡。呂不韋為相，封十萬戶，號曰文信侯。招致賓客游士，欲以并天下。李斯為舍人。蒙驁、王齮、麃公等為將軍。王年少，初即位，委國事大臣。晉陽反。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m001-0000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"秦始皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000533","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m001-0006","start":6,"end":10,"surface":"秦莊襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000310","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m001-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"莊襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000310","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m001-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"秦質子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或王稱指代待核；不補造姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m001-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"呂不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000530","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m001-0027","start":27,"end":28,"surface":"姬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000542","status":"contextual_pr